---
import {testEnvironment as env} from '../data/measurement-sessions';
interface Props {compact?:boolean}
const {compact=false}=Astro.props;
const fields=[['运营商',env.operator],['接入带宽',env.bandwidthMbps?env.bandwidthMbps+' Mbps':null],['设备与系统',[env.device,env.operatingSystem].filter(Boolean).join(' / ')||null],['客户端与版本',[env.client,env.clientVersion].filter(Boolean).join(' / ')||null],['协议',env.protocol],['测试时区',env.timeZone]];
---
<div class:list={['test-environment',{'is-compact':compact}]} data-test-environment={env.id}>
 <div class="reader-value-heading"><h3>统一测试环境</h3><span class="tag neutral">站长已确认</span></div>
 <p>站长于 <time datetime={env.confirmedAt}>{env.confirmedAt}</time> 确认：本期全部测速与解锁图使用同一测试环境。各图测试日期分别保留，不作为同一时点的品牌竞速排名。</p>
 <details><summary>查看环境参数与待补充项目</summary><dl class="environment-fields">{fields.map(([label,value])=><div><dt>{label}</dt><dd>{value||'具体参数待补充'}</dd></div>)}</dl><p>同一环境确认日期与原图测试时间是两项记录；缺失的参数不会根据图片或速度反推。</p><a class="text-link" href="/downloads/test-environment-template.csv" download>下载环境记录表 CSV ↓</a></details>
</div>
